<title>USA: Commercial Metals completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Commercial Metals completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commercial Metals Co on Friday said it completed its acquisition of Allegheny Heat Treating Co, a provider of custom steel heat-treating services.</p>
<p>Terms of the acquisition were not disclosed. Officials from Commercial Metals were not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>Chicora, Pennsylvania-based Allegheny will keep its name and operate as a wholly owned unit of Commercial Metals, a Dallas-based maker of steel and metal products.</p>
<p>Allegheny has the capacity to process about 30,000 tons of steel a year.</p>
</text>
